<h2>1. Commitment</h2>
<p>
	Attorney Todor Hinkov is committed to making the website <span class="placeholder">[domain]</span>
	accessible to the widest possible range of users, including people with disabilities, regardless of the
	devices and assistive technologies they use.
</p>
<p>
	The website does not fall within the scope of the Bulgarian E-Government Act and Directive (EU) 2016/2102,
	which apply to public sector bodies. This statement is voluntary and reflects good practice.
</p>

<h2>2. Conformance status</h2>
<p>
	The website has been designed and developed in accordance with <strong>WCAG 2.2, level AA</strong>. As at
	the date of publication, no non-conformance is known, except for the limitations listed in section 4.
</p>
<p><span class="placeholder">[Confirm the status after final testing with real content – “fully conforms” / “partially conforms”.]</span></p>

<h2>3. What has been done</h2>
<ul>
	<li>semantic HTML structure with a clear heading hierarchy and landmarks;</li>
	<li>full keyboard navigation, a visible focus state and a “Skip to main content” link;</li>
	<li>colour contrast of text and controls meeting level AA;</li>
	<li>text alternatives for images and ARIA attributes for icons and interactive elements;</li>
	<li>labels for all form fields, clear error messages and confirmation of successful submission;</li>
	<li>a responsive layout that works at 200% zoom and on screens from 320 px wide;</li>
	<li>respect for the system reduced-motion setting (prefers-reduced-motion);</li>
	<li>content remains accessible with JavaScript disabled;</li>
	<li>the interface is available in Bulgarian and English, and the language of each page is declared for assistive technologies.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Known limitations</h2>
<ul>
	<li>External websites linked from this site (for example LinkedIn and Microsoft Bookings) are outside the controller's control and may not meet the same level of accessibility.</li>
	<li>Sample articles and draft legal documents are being replaced with final content; alternative texts and structure will be reviewed again at that point.</li>
	<li><span class="placeholder">[Add any other limitations identified during testing – e.g. PDF documents, embedded map.]</span></li>
</ul>

